3] We can debug
Lets check if the openldap server  accept SASL
root@ansible:~# sudo -u nslcd ldapsearch     -H ldaps://openldap.vagrant-dummy-ops.lab:636 -Y EXTERNAL -o TLS_CERT=/etc/ssl/localcerts/vagrant_nslcd-client.crt -o TLS_KEY=/etc/ssl/localcerts/vagrant_nslcd-client.key -b "" -s base supportedSASLMechanisms
